libodraw is a library to access to optical disc (split) RAW image files (bin/cue, iso/cue).

Project information:

* Status: alpha
* Licence: LGPL-3.0-or-later

Planned:

* Multi-threading support

For more information see:

* Project documentation: https://github.com/libyal/libodraw/wiki/Home
* How to build from source: https://github.com/libyal/libodraw/wiki/Building

